p=photos['peter'];sid='122149460913172155';url='https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid='+sid;slug='bezos-princeton-kindness-choices-study-abroad'
title=t('聰明之外，練習善意：貝佐斯演講給留學家庭的提醒','Beyond cleverness: a kindness lesson for families preparing to study abroad')
desc=t('Peter以2010年普林斯頓演講談合作與選擇；善意也需要界線，不是替別人完成作業。','Peter draws on the 2010 Princeton address to discuss cooperation and choices. Kindness includes boundaries; it does not mean doing someone else’s work.')
pairs=[('Peter最新貼文把留學準備從成績拉回日常選擇：在團隊裡，是只急著證明自己比較快，還是願意讓對方理解？文中的小嵐合作情境是示例，不是本刊採訪的真實學生故事。','Peter’s latest post shifts attention from grades to everyday choices: in a team, do you rush to prove that you are faster, or help someone understand? The Xiaolan scenario is illustrative, not a student interviewed by this publication.'),('原始背景是Jeff Bezos於2010年5月30日在普林斯頓Baccalaureate活動演講，談及童年用吸菸統計數字令祖母難過，以及祖父對善意的提醒。普林斯頓官方紀錄與校報The Daily Princetonian當日報導均可交叉核對，不能把活動誤寫成今年的新演講。','The background is Jeff Bezos’s Princeton Baccalaureate address on May 30, 2010. He recalled upsetting his grandmother with calculations about smoking and receiving a lesson about kindness from his grandfather. Princeton’s account and The Daily Princetonian’s same-day report corroborate the occasion; it is not a new speech this year.'),('Peter將故事延伸為家庭可練習的行動：合作前先問需求，提出不同意見時說清楚理由，完成後回看自己是否讓他人有參與空間。這是對演講的教育詮釋，並非演講原文列出的留學申請策略，也不是對貝佐斯所有商業決策的背書。','Peter turns the story into practical family exercises: ask what is needed before collaborating, explain disagreements and reflect on whether others had room to contribute. This is an educational interpretation, not an admissions strategy prescribed by the speech or an endorsement of all Bezos’s business decisions.'),('善意與界線可以同時存在。協助同學理解題目，與替同學交出整份作業不同；願意傾聽，也不表示必須接受所有要求。對準備跨文化學習的學生，具體可練習的是提問、分工與回饋，不能把「表現友善」當作保證名校錄取的技巧。','Kindness and boundaries can coexist. Helping a classmate understand a task differs from submitting the work for them; listening does not require accepting every request. Students preparing for intercultural learning can practise questions, shared responsibilities and feedback, without treating friendliness as a guarantee of admission.'),('編輯核對：原生粉專顯示「17小時前」，保留相對時間，不虛構發布時分。UCAS及WO／HBO等較早貼文已匯入，會員宣傳不列入今日教育文章。本篇以授權校園資料照搭配已核對改編，保留Peter原文連結供讀者對照。','Editorial check: the native page displayed “17 hours ago”; we retain that relative label without inventing an exact posting time. Earlier UCAS and WO/HBO posts were already imported, and membership promotion is excluded from today’s educational articles. This verified adaptation uses a licensed campus photograph and links to Peter’s original.')]
a=dict(slug=slug,title=title,date=D,category=t('留學準備','Study abroad preparation'),country=t('美國','United States'),excerpt=desc,description=desc,sourceId=sid,sourceUrl=url,image='/'+p['file'].removeprefix('public/'),imageAlt=t('普林斯頓Streicker Bridge校園實景資料照','Archive photograph of Streicker Bridge at Princeton'),imageCredit=p['author']+' / '+p['license'],imageSource=p['source'],imageLicense=p['license'],imageRights=p['license'],imageCaption=t('普林斯頓資料照，非演講現場或Peter原貼文圖卡。','Princeton archive photograph, not the speech or Peter’s original card.'),body=[t(z,e) for z,e in pairs],sources=[['Peter — original post',url],['Princeton — May 30, 2010 address','https://www.princeton.edu/news/2010/05/30/choices-shape-lives-bezos-tells-seniors'],['The Daily Princetonian — independent event reporting','https://www.dailyprincetonian.com/article/2010/05/amazon-com-ceo-bezos-86-delivers-2010-baccalaureate-address']],topic=t('善意與合作','Kindness and cooperation'),author='Peter',importedAt=D,originalDateLabel=t('原生頁面顯示17小時前','Native page displayed 17 hours ago'),originalDatePrecision='relative',dateObservedAt=NOW,edition='verified-edit',note=t('已讀原文；相對時間不轉寫為精確發布時間。','Original post read; relative time is not converted into an exact timestamp.'))
