r['studyAbroadPrepared']=write('jp','japan-kinjo-coeducation-transition-checklist','日本金城學院選校：共學公告之後，還要確認哪一年入學','Choosing Kinjo Gakuin in Japan: match the transition to your intake','用日本女子大學改制作選校練習，分清公告、核准、學位授予與自己入學年度。','Use a Japanese university transition to distinguish announcements, approval, the degree-awarding institution and your intake year.',[
('從校園照片開始查','Start with the campus, then check the plan','照片是名古屋金城學院校園資料照。校方2026年7月公告共學方向，預計2029年4月開始，並與設置者移轉相連。對台灣學生，看到新招生方向時，第一步應是核對自己的預定入學年度是否在適用範圍，不能把未來共學當成今年已開放。','The photograph is an archive view of Kinjo Gakuin in Nagoya. Its July 2026 announcement envisages coeducation from April 2029 alongside an institutional transfer. Taiwanese students should first match their intended intake to the plan; a future change does not mean admission is already open this year.'),
('把學位路徑寫清楚','Write down the degree pathway','編輯建議向校方取得書面說明：所讀學部、授予學位的機構、課程完成安排與適用年級。中日新聞另報導董事會及校友意見蒐集，顯示改制包含程序與社群面向；本次未取得每個年級完整過渡細則，不能保證所有條件不變。','Our editorial guidance is to obtain written details of the faculty, degree-awarding institution, course-completion arrangements and affected cohorts. Chunichi Shimbun also reports board and alumni processes, showing the procedural and community dimensions. We did not obtain transition rules for every cohort and cannot guarantee unchanged conditions.'),
('用導航做比較，再回到原文','Compare through the guide, then return to primary sources','可用留學DIY導航整理日本學校，再把正式募集要項、語言要求、費用與住宿逐欄核對。共學或改名本身不等於新增獎學金、提高就業率或保證錄取。把未公布的部分標成待確認，能避免將同名校區或其他大學的資料誤填進自己的計畫。','Use the study-abroad guide to organise Japanese options, then compare formal admissions guidance, language requirements, fees and housing. Coeducation or renaming does not itself create scholarships, improve employment outcomes or guarantee admission. Mark unpublished details as unresolved rather than filling gaps with information from another campus or institution.')],[('Kinjo Gakuin — official coeducation announcement','https://www.kinjo-u.ac.jp/ja/news/detail/?id=2864'),('Chunichi Shimbun — independent board and alumni context','https://edu.chunichi.co.jp/news/detail/12914/u00015')],'study-abroad',dict(category=t('留學DIY導航','Study abroad DIY'),country=t('日本','Japan'),topic='asia'))
